<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 3.125 µm for Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (Pass 2) — Model fidelity to source: 90/100" ;
