<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 3.125 µm for Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (Pass 2) — MorphoEval overall 87.7/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 keeps the Pass-1 law (λ_c = 3.125 µm, r = 0.99937, equal-diffusion σ_max = -0.458 /s, sweep 3.146–3.993 µm) and adds a 48×36 pleural patch whose dominant wavelength is 3.125 µm (k_dom/k_c = 1.000), distinct from the 1D fastest mode at 3.146 µm. The comparison figure now draws the specimen contour, prints KS = 0.067, and states the holaspis18 copy ratio 1.50 at fixed k_c. GIF is 720×560 and 16 frames; last-frame CV similarity to the Commons photograph is 95.7. Counted furrows remain 11 against the assigned 12. Overall 87.7/100 (faithfulness 87.6, reproducibility 88.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 90, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 88, Morphometric validation 90, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 473511 B, 1500×1080 px, artifact_sha256 359856907d3dc0849ccbc92ca7768f40e0ce881f7ba4bb2da5f64a3518951f79 (sha256 359856907d3dc0849ccbc92ca7768f40e0ce881f7ba4bb2da5f64a3518951f79), spec_fingerprint a620df60d6c5b5e97ca4ce3d5911512c60ca0cb80af273a47beb27e51cc495ce. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a620df60d6c5b5e97ca4ce3d5911512c60ca0cb80af273a47beb27e51cc495ce; artifact_sha256: 359856907d3dc0849ccbc92ca7768f40e0ce881f7ba4bb2da5f64a3518951f79; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=61b94136e918acb9..., datasets/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=50ac5dbca8261978...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-27-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Meraspid Aulacopleura adds thoracic segments; holaspid number varies (Fusco et al. 2004; Hughes & Chapman 1995). | Turing 1952 selects an intrinsic chemical wavelength; Schnakenberg 1979 supplies the two-species kinetics.; reconstructed_in_script: a=0.0625, b=0.875, D_u=2e-12 m^2/s, D_v/D_u = 1.02 × r_crit, and γ are solved so λ_c = 3.125 µm. | The 2D patch is a periodic epithelial rectangle seeded with a transverse lira plus mediolateral noise. | The M12 to holaspis18 change at this scale is the segment surplus 6 at fixed k_c (copy ratio 1.5).; transfer_boundary: Murray 1981 is used only as the scale argument that domain length, not k_c, changes the number of hosted wavelengths.; does_not_claim: That 3.125 µm was measured on the photograph. | That the dorsal photograph is a verified degree-12 meraspis (counted furrows are 11). | That a Turing mechanism operated in the Silurian animal. | That a second, independent assessor scored this audit.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Counted axial furrows are 11, not the assigned meraspid degree 12. The dorsal photo is not demonstrated to be an M12 individual.",
        "remediation needed: Still one assessor. A second model has not scored these dimensions.",
        "remediation needed: The Commons photograph has no scale bar, so λ_c = 3.125 µm is not an image measurement.",
        "remediation needed: The dispersion fit uses the discrete Laplacian symbol on one grid. A continuum-limit refinement study is not included." ;
    pk:hasScore 8.77e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
