<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 3.125 µm for Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (Pass 2) (Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (12 thoracic segments, Wenlock, 428.5 Ma))",
        "Schnakenberg critical wavelength at 3.125 µm for Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (Pass 2) faithfully reproduces Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (12 thoracic segments, Wenlock, 428.5 Ma) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0.py, docs/media/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (12 thoracic segments, Wenlock, 428.5 Ma) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/docs/media/aulacopleura_koninckii_meraspis_turing_wavelength_s0_growth.gif>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-aulacopleura-koninckii-meraspis-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
    schema:about "Aulacopleura koninckii meraspis (12 thoracic segments, Wenlock, 428.5 Ma)" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: That 3.125 µm was measured on the photograph.",
        "does_not_claim: That a Turing mechanism operated in the Silurian animal.",
        "does_not_claim: That a second, independent assessor scored this audit.",
        "does_not_claim: That the dorsal photograph is a verified degree-12 meraspis (counted furrows are 11).",
        "reconstructed_in_script: The 2D patch is a periodic epithelial rectangle seeded with a transverse lira plus mediolateral noise.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: The M12 to holaspis18 change at this scale is the segment surplus 6 at fixed k_c (copy ratio 1.5).",
        "reconstructed_in_script: a=0.0625, b=0.875, D_u=2e-12 m^2/s, D_v/D_u = 1.02 × r_crit, and γ are solved so λ_c = 3.125 µm.",
        "reported_in_source: Meraspid Aulacopleura adds thoracic segments; holaspid number varies (Fusco et al. 2004; Hughes & Chapman 1995).",
        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952 selects an intrinsic chemical wavelength; Schnakenberg 1979 supplies the two-species kinetics.",
        "transfer_boundary: Murray 1981 is used only as the scale argument that domain length, not k_c, changes the number of hosted wavelengths." ;
    pk:anatomicalStructure "Turing pigment stripe / ocellus wavelength in Aulacopleura koninckii_meraspis (Silurian (Wenlock Epoch, 428.5 Ma))" ;
    pk:aristotelianEfficientCause "1. Chemical Turing / RD" ;
    pk:aristotelianMegistonGenos "II. Anaima (Invertebrata)" ;
    pk:aristotelianPoionForm "Stripes, Spots & Ocelli" ;
    pk:aristotelianPosonLaw "Turing Wavenumber k_c" ;
    pk:aristotelianSubalternClass "Entoma (Arthropoda)" ;
